   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Challenge Fund Manual Set-up in Kosovo &#x2013; HELVETAS is a short-term intervention focused on preparatory work and designing a manual for the Challenge Fund ahead of its launch in early 2026. The intervention is part of a larger initiative within Greening Private Enterprises in Kosovo (GPEK).</narrative>
